The real closed source of VIII09 is

  `Q3 x = (3/8)[2Z̄ − Ū + n(Z̄ + x Z̄′) + (8−9x)x Ū]`

with `n(x) = 1 - 4x + 3x² = (1-x)(1-3x) ≥ 0` on `KG = [0,1/3]`.  This file proves, on the whole
