  `Ū ≤ −5/72`,  `2Z̄ − Ū ≤ −5x/48`,  `Z̄ ≤ −5/144`,  `Z̄′ ≤ −5/576`.

The strong negativity of `Q3` comes from the **whole combination**, not from a term-by-term
strict positivity: at `x = 1/3` the coefficient `n` vanishes, so `n > 0` may never be used.
